{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國博彩協會委託Qualtrics開展的一項民意調查顯示，82%的美國受訪者跨越黨派分歧，認為預測市場應當被作為博彩產品而非金融產品進行監管。調查還發現，75%的受訪者認為，通過預測市場買賣與體育賽事相關的事件合約，與通過體育博彩平台下注沒有區別。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586276.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:21:56.843729+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_hash":"2780afb76dffd37402902a6dfbabbc7587e5ba1f304068fdcbcd776010ce585e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}